            "id": "b-xn0y74fl8mk",
            "type": "text",
            "content": "# The Haunted Catch\n\nThis is my take on a hammerhead shark character originally designed by Oscar Ibanez.\n\nI really liked the concept and thought it would be a fun challenge to bring it into 3D. I focused on keeping the character's exaggerated shapes and personality while adding my own touches through the sculpting, textures, and final presentation.\n\nI had a lot of fun working on this one, especially with the facial expression, the little details, and the Halloween atmosphere.\n\n**Original Concept:** Oscar Ibanez  \n**3D Modeling & Texturing:** Jordan Ferrary",
